# SGC204 race (trace half) — one writer, run twice at once inside one episode by
# the `*>` fan-out. One arrival, so the static half is quiet; the write is read
# off its verb (a guess), so binding drops to advisory.
# expect: warn:10:SGC204
#!spec
(User) -> [Api] : go()
[Api] *> [A] & [B] : run()
[A] -> [W] : save()
[B] -> [W] : save()
[W] -> |Doc| : put({Doc})
